book.nourished.nourished_guide.server_ow:
Copy the entry you want to change out of an export file and into [#](B88CFF)food_overrides.json[#](), then add [#](6FB8E8)enabled: true[#]():

{ "item": "minecraft:steak", "nutrients": { "proteins": 0.8 }, "calories": 60, "enabled": true }

Only entries actually present in [#](B88CFF)food_overrides.json[#]() take effect — the export files themselves are ignored.
